### REST Client (VS Code "REST Client" extension / JetBrains HTTP Client)
@host = http://localhost:4000

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare Ziptrrip assignment",
  "description": "Backend + frontend + docs",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-31"
}

### List all
GET {{host}}/api/todos

### List with filters (status, q, priority, sort, order)
GET {{host}}/api/todos?status=active&priority=high&sort=dueDate&order=asc&q=assignment

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Update (partial)
PATCH {{host}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "completed": true }

### PUT behaves like PATCH
PUT {{host}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Updated title", "priority": "low", "dueDate": null }

### Delete one
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos/1

### Clear all completed
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos?completed=true

### Validation error example (400)
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }
